    {
      "id": "ask_memory_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "覚えてるか、だね。そこは慎重に答えたい。",
      "translatedText": "Whether I remember. I want to answer that carefully.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_memory_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_memory_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "記録があることなら、ちゃんと確かめられる。ないことを、あったみたいには言いたくない。",
      "translatedText": "If there is a record, I can check it properly. I do not want to pretend something happened if it did not.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "That feels careful.",
          "nextId": "ask_memory_001_careful",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "trust",
              "amount": 0.25,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "comfort",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I want you to remember me.",
          "nextId": "ask_memory_001_want",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "reassurance",
              "amount": 0.2,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "attention",
              "amount": 0.2,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "key": "player_wants_memory_continuity",
              "value": "true",
              "amount": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "ask_memory_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_memory_001_careful",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "うん。大事なものほど、雑に扱いたくないから。",
      "translatedText": "Mm. The more important something is, the less I want to handle it carelessly.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_memory_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_memory_001_want",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "……そう言われると、少し緊張する。でも、嬉しい緊張。",
      "translatedText": "When you say that, I get a little nervous. But it is a happy kind of nervous.",
      "emotion": "shy",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "shy",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_memory_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_memory_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "でも、覚えたいとは思ってる。そこは本当。",
      "translatedText": "But I do want to remember. That part is true.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
